Alpine RV64 rootfs helper
=========================

Default source:
  https://dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org/alpine/latest-stable/releases/riscv64/latest-releases.yaml

Default APK repositories:
  https://dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org/alpine/latest-stable/main/riscv64
  https://dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org/alpine/latest-stable/community/riscv64

Default package set:
  busybox openrc nftables iptables iproute2 curl

Generated files stay under:
  target/rootfs/alpine-rv64-qemu
  target/images/alpine-cache

Regenerate with:
  tools/images/fetch-alpine-rv64.sh

Mutable latest-stable release and APK index metadata is refreshed on each run;
downloaded minirootfs and APK payloads remain cached.

Build with:
  cargo xtask image cpio --profile alpine --target rv64-qemu

In a host terminal:
  mkdir -p /tmp/tx-curl-www
  printf 'TX_CURL_HOST_OK\n' > /tmp/tx-curl-www/index.html
  python3 -m http.server 18080 --bind 127.0.0.1 --directory /tmp/tx-curl-www

In another host terminal:
  cargo xtask qemu --target rv64-qemu --profile alpine --net user --interactive

In the guest shell:
  ip link set eth0 up
  ip addr add 10.0.2.15/24 dev eth0 2>/dev/null || true
  ip route add default via 10.0.2.2 2>/dev/null || true
  curl -fsS --max-time 10 http://10.0.2.2:18080/index.html
